PARAMETER P0(VARE) Price at consumption level used in model;
P0(VARE) = P0_Org(VARE,'CNLS');
*
* Projection from base year to simulation year
P0(VARE) = P0(VARE) * (1 + KPI) ** (Y - %BAS%);
*
* mill kg
* Source: Markedsdata.xlsx
PARAMETER X0TOT(VARE) Gross consumption at consumer level average 2023-2025 /
HVEM     328.9511 
RUGM     13.7951 
BYGM     9.6909 
HAVM     25.8118 
